<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Talented</ansi> mutation

Your body and mind adapt at an accelerated rate, growing stronger
with each challenge. But the raw instinctive learning of technique
suffers.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Slightly faster stat progression — strength, dexterity, and
  other core attributes improve more readily with use

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slightly slower skill progression — combat techniques and learned
  disciplines advance more slowly

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Skilled

